Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.37,0:00:14.58,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.58,0:00:15.77,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Did you bite your tongue?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.24,0:00:20.95,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's my tooth...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.95,0:00:22.56,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's wobbly...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.56,0:00:23.92,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't touch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.57,0:00:25.65,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.31,0:00:30.67,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You have another one coming in under it, so just leave it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.77,0:00:34.23,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Do you want your rice as porridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.23,0:00:37.46,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No, it'll be fine if I eat slowly.
