Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.62,0:01:52.00,OP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}{\1c&H827B25&}O{\1c&H778D3B&}u{\1c&H709A4A&}r{\1c&H6AA457&} {\1c&H64AF63&}w{\1c&H5ABF77&}i{\1c&H56C680&}s{\1c&H4FD38E&}h{\1c&H48E09E&} {\1c&H43E8A8&}i{\1c&H4EE2AC&}s{\1c&H5FD9B2&} {\1c&H6ED1B7&}t{\1c&H7FC7BD&}o{\1c&H92BDC3&} {\1c&HA3B4C8&}b{\1c&HB8A8CF&}e{\1c&HCA9ED5&} {\1c&HDC95DB&}h{\1c&HED8DDD&}a{\1c&HEE95CE&}p{\1c&HEF9DBF&}p{\1c&HF0A5B1&}y{\1c&HF0AAA6&},{\1c&HF1AF9D&} {\1c&HF2B68F&}h{\1c&HF3BE80&}a{\1c&HF4C672&}p{\1c&HEDC46B&}p{\1c&HD5AF75&}y{\1c&HC6A27C&},{\1c&HB69383&} {\1c&H9F7E8D&}h{\1c&H866798&}a{\1c&H6E51A2&}p{\1c&H563BAD&}p{\1c&H3E26B7&}y{\1c&H3019BE&}!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.00,0:01:55.80,OP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}{\1c&H827B25&}A{\1c&H778D3A&}n{\1c&H6F9B4B&}d{\1c&H66AA5D&} {\1c&H60B56A&}t{\1c&H59C179&}h{\1c&H50D18C&}o{\1c&H48E09E&}s{\1c&H4BE4AB&}e{\1c&H61D8B2&} {\1c&H73CEB9&}d{\1c&H8BC1C0&}a{\1c&HA3B4C8&}y{\1c&HB9A8D0&}s{\1c&HCC9DD6&} {\1c&HE490DE&}w{\1c&HED91D7&}i{\1c&HEE95CF&}l{\1c&HEE98C8&}l{\1c&HEF9EBE&} {\1c&HF0A6AF&}b{\1c&HF1AF9E&}e{\1c&HF2B690&} {\1c&HF3BE80&}h{\1c&HF4C76F&}a{\1c&HE5BE6E&}p{\1c&HCAA57A&}p{\1c&HAF8C86&}y{\1c&H9E7D8D&},{\1c&H8C6C95&} {\1c&H77599E&}t{\1c&H5C41AA&}o{\1c&H4128B6&}o{\1c&H3019BE&}!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.01,0:02:03.39,OP,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\blur1}{\1c&H827B25&}J{\1c&H778D3B&}u{\1c&H6D9F50&}s{\1c&H63AF64&}t{\1c&H5BBD75&} {\1c&H53CC87&}w{\1c&H45E4A4&}a{\1c&H59DCB0&}n{\1c&H74CEB9&}n{\1c&H8FBFC2&}a{\1c&HA9B1CA&} {\1c&HC5A1D3&}m{\1c&HE98EDF&}a{\1c&HEE95CF&}k{\1c&HEF9FBC&}e{\1c&HF0A8AB&} {\1c&HF1B199&}y{\1c&HF3BC84&}o{\1c&HF4C771&}u{\1c&HEAC26C&} {\1c&HCAA57A&}h{\1c&HA88689&}a{\1c&H876897&}p{\1c&H6549A6&}p{\1c&H442BB4&}y{\1c&H3019BE&}!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.56,0:02:24.68,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.21,0:02:26.09,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.88,0:02:34.59,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,W-Why the rush?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.72,0:02:38.25,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Look, there's my drawing!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.23,0:02:45.97,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Your dad always comes to these things, huh Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.26,0:02:46.86,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.86,0:02:49.28,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Although he's not my dad...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.77,0:02:50.90,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,He's not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.58,0:02:55.64,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, it's pretty good.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.64,0:02:56.73,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Say, did you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.00,0:03:00.24,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Rin's the best artist in Class B!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.61,0:03:01.89,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You don't say...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.05,0:03:05.45,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I bet you could become a comic artist!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.12,0:03:07.12,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.12,0:03:09.15,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sure you could!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.93,0:03:17.05,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.05,0:03:18.97,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.16,0:03:25.68,Default,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry I'm late.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.68,0:03:29.43,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,This stylish guy is her dad?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.43,0:03:30.78,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,How handsome!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.78,0:03:31.93,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,Lucky!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.93,0:03:33.61,Default,Kids,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}He's so tall! {overlap}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.93,0:03:36.98,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Guess what! Sayaka's dad is 31, just like you, Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.21,0:03:39.19,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.40,0:03:43.16,Default,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Really? What a happy coincidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.38,0:03:48.75,Default,Sayaka,0000,0000,0000,,My papa's a model!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.47,0:03:50.45,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.45,0:03:52.07,Default,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Come on now, Sayaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.85,0:03:54.36,Default,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Just a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.36,0:03:56.47,Default,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,When I was younger...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.81,0:04:02.34,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I think I might've seen you in my company's catalog before...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.16,0:04:04.60,Default,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.99,0:04:07.19,Default,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Hold on...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.19,0:04:09.52,Default,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Might I ask the name of your company?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.90,0:04:13.62,Default,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,That really might be me!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.62,0:04:15.38,Default,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,I'm so flattered!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.38,0:04:17.52,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Cheerful guy, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.98,0:04:17.17,Default,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}How embarrassing! {overlap}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.52,0:04:20.52,Default,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just a manager for my agency these days.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.52,0:04:22.25,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.58,0:04:24.90,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It seems like kind of a waste...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.90,0:04:27.95,Default,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,You don't have a steady income or hours when you model,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.95,0:04:30.70,Default,Sayaka's Dad,0000,0000,0000,,so when my daughter was born, I called it a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.98,0:04:32.00,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.25,0:04:38.05,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,While I spent every night drinking and bitching about work...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.05,0:04:39.67,Default,Nabe-chin,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Mi!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.94,0:04:42.86,Default,Mi-chan,0000,0000,0000,,Nabe! Long time no see!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.20,0:04:45.84,Default,Mi-chan,0000,0000,0000,,We were classmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.84,0:04:47.27,Default,Mi-chan,0000,0000,0000,,We're from the same neighborhood.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.27,0:04:50.43,Default,Mi-chan,0000,0000,0000,,He's got a boy in Class A.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.99,0:04:54.10,Default,Mi-chan,0000,0000,0000,,This is Rin's father, Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.10,0:04:55.60,Default,Mi-chan,0000,0000,0000,,He's the same age as us.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.82,0:04:57.81,Default,Nabe-chin,0000,0000,0000,,Oh yeah? Nice to meet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.06,0:04:59.33,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Likewise.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.89,0:05:04.41,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,These two are the type that protect their kids...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.41,0:05:05.78,Default,Rib,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.92,0:05:11.65,Default,Nabe-chin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a butcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.65,0:05:13.33,Default,Nabe-chin,0000,0000,0000,,My shop's on the corner of that shopping street.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.33,0:05:16.02,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin and I often get take-out croquettes there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.02,0:05:18.59,Default,Nabe-chin,0000,0000,0000,,Really? I'm so happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.59,0:05:19.78,Default,Mi-chan,0000,0000,0000,,Me too! I do too!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.78,0:05:21.64,Default,Nabe-chin,0000,0000,0000,,Well I know {\i1}that{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.30,0:05:31.83,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I made some papa-pals...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.80,0:06:04.43,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,In a sense, the world may be wider here...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.42,0:06:12.71,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Hey there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.71,0:06:14.22,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.56,0:06:16.80,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It got cold pretty fast, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.80,0:06:17.83,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.83,0:06:20.78,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It seems the kids are already in the gym.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.78,0:06:22.98,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I just hope he has his jacket on...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.98,0:06:23.88,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.13,0:06:28.11,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, he's quite the artist.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.38,0:06:29.92,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.92,0:06:32.16,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, you can tell he put a lot of time into it...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.07,0:06:40.33,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You know, everybody else is in the gym already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.60,0:06:42.62,Default,Nobu,0000,0000,0000,,Seriously?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.62,0:06:45.74,Default,Nobu,0000,0000,0000,,Crap! My teacher's gonna be mad!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.74,0:06:47.92,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Boys will be boys...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.52,0:06:51.30,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, how adorable! How many months?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.63,0:06:53.65,Default,Mother with Child,0000,0000,0000,,Almost 10 months now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.20,0:06:56.93,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I love babies!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.49,0:07:00.17,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,How nostalgic...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.90,0:07:06.76,Default,MotherA,0000,0000,0000,,So my kid had the flu last week...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.78,0:07:07.34,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}I'm sorry I've kept you... {overlap}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.76,0:07:09.44,Default,MotherB,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, really? That must've been rough.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.46,0:07:08.37,Default,Mother with Child,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Not at all! {overlap}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.44,0:07:11.08,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Is it that season already?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.08,0:07:13.79,Default,MotherB,0000,0000,0000,,They have to stay home for two days even if the fever's down, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.79,0:07:14.70,Default,MotherB,0000,0000,0000,,So it doesn't spread...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.87,0:07:19.46,Default,MotherA,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, but I sent him to school right after his temperature went down.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.93,0:07:21.59,Default,MotherB,0000,0000,0000,,Well, what else could you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.59,0:07:23.45,Default,MotherB,0000,0000,0000,,You don't wanna be fired either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.45,0:07:27.75,Default,MotherA,0000,0000,0000,,Right, and he was getting better, so the virus was probably weak anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.75,0:07:29.02,Default,MotherB,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I'm sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.02,0:07:33.59,Default,MotherA,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, even if he did pass it on, nobody would ever know who did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.45,0:07:38.73,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Shall we depart?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.66,0:07:53.17,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Um... What those mothers were talking about kind of hit home...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.65,0:07:56.96,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,And that makes me even more depressed...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.83,0:08:01.35,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I can relate with the work situation...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.35,0:08:03.71,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, I know...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.64,0:08:07.98,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,When it gets cold out, I become a nervous wreck.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.98,0:08:09.95,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,With Kouki the way he is...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.71,0:08:12.65,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Put your pajamas on now!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.91,0:08:21.51,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,But once winter ends and it starts getting warm, I can relax.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.75,0:08:24.69,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.38,0:08:33.07,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, wait while I go grab my bag!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.46,0:08:34.97,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Are you two kidding me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.97,0:08:36.07,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, your nose!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.26,0:08:39.32,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I told you to wear your jacket because it's cold in the gym!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.32,0:08:40.72,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And don't run in the halls!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.72,0:08:42.08,Default,Kouki and Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.82,0:08:44.88,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't run, hear me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.15,0:08:50.95,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki's baby teeth are already starting to come out, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.95,0:08:54.85,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,We live in an apartment complex, so we can't really toss them onto the roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.85,0:08:58.33,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,And he hasn't been listening to me at all lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.77,0:09:02.18,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I can't really talk...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.91,0:09:04.58,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I used to wear the absolute minimum...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.58,0:09:07.31,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And run down the stairs full speed, skipping every other step...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.55,0:09:10.69,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'd wolf down lunch, drink the milk in one gulp...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.98,0:09:15.83,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It feels really weird telling kids not to do everything that {\i1}I did{\i0}.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.83,0:09:18.82,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You did all that, Daikichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.82,0:09:21.12,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I think it's normal for a boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.62,0:09:25.34,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, I don't think of Kouki as just another kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.00,0:09:28.51,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,S-Sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.51,0:09:32.09,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,But if you were like that too, Daikichi,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.09,0:09:34.33,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,then I'm a little more relieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.57,0:09:44.67,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong? Walk with Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.67,0:09:45.89,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I don't wanna!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.89,0:09:49.25,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Then let's split into the boys' team and girls' team!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.25,0:09:50.48,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I don't wanna!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.09,0:09:54.42,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't Rin's face a bit flushed?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.55,0:10:02.24,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I think she's got a fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.02,0:10:06.41,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It might get higher.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.01,0:10:12.68,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Way more flushed than normal!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.69,0:10:25.05,Default,Doctor,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it's not the flu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.18,0:10:29.19,Default,Doctor,0000,0000,0000,,For now, please have all of the family members wear a mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.18,0:10:31.05,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.85,0:10:33.10,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's good news, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.10,0:10:34.01,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.88,0:10:41.82,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.04,0:10:45.91,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Are you done?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.91,0:10:49.71,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah... It feels kinda weird here...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.11,0:10:53.96,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,The doctor said it was the stomach flu, so you don't have to force yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.14,0:10:56.46,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah... I feel kind of...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.31,0:10:57.92,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.07,0:11:00.93,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,W-Washbowl!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.10,0:11:14.44,Sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnFansub Block\bord0\org(345,267)\frz319.929\pos(505,51)\fscx776.25\fscy183.75\blur5\c&H333934&}A
Dialogue: 4,0:11:12.10,0:11:14.44,Sign,,0000,0000,0000,,{\bord0\c&H0D110C&\blur1\fn04b03\fscx166.25\fscy181.25\pos(600,209)\frz320.205}103.64{\fnProfile}°{\fn04b03}F
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.96,0:11:24.25,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Rin does?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.24,0:11:25.99,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Call an ambulance right away!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.24,0:11:29.37,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}No, I already had her checked out by a doctor and we got medicine,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.37,0:11:31.16,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}but she won't take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.16,0:11:33.42,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Her fever keeps climbing higher and she looks like she's suffering...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.42,0:11:35.88,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}I bet you had her wear light clothes!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.88,0:11:37.80,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That's not important!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.82,0:11:40.37,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,Did you try mixing the medicine in with juice?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.93,0:11:43.99,Default,Sachiko,0000,0000,0000,,You always drank it right away if it was mixed with something sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.54,0:11:46.92,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'll try it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.92,0:11:48.18,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks, Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.92,0:11:59.40,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Here, just try a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.40,0:12:00.36,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.98,0:12:02.93,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Come on, just a spoonful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.72,0:12:08.91,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.51,0:12:39.37,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry for coming so early.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.37,0:12:41.25,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,How's Rin doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.25,0:12:43.00,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.00,0:12:43.79,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,May I come in?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.79,0:12:46.93,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,{\a6}Daikichi, what's with that hair? {overlap}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.86,0:12:45.53,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.17,0:12:51.70,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She doesn't have the flu, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.64,0:12:55.15,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, go watch TV over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.15,0:12:56.23,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.23,0:12:57.17,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Quietly!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.43,0:13:03.23,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She just managed to fall asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.35,0:13:10.76,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Her fever keeps rising...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.76,0:13:12.85,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,And it seems like she can't really sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.85,0:13:15.05,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She's not sweating at all...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.05,0:13:17.23,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Can she take fluids?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.17,0:13:21.69,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I was told to at least give her sports drinks,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.69,0:13:24.04,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,but she won't eat or drink anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.04,0:13:25.78,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I don't know what to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.40,0:13:29.33,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,W-What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.42,0:13:33.20,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You can't get worried!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.17,0:13:40.11,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,The adult has to stay calm and tell her it's going to be all right...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.87,0:13:42.41,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,It's hard.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.41,0:13:44.97,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I've never seen Rin like that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.30,0:13:47.72,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's not hard! You can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.13,0:13:50.64,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,When a child is in real trouble,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.64,0:13:53.48,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,an adult who can help needs to be by their side.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.27,0:14:01.17,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Rin will be fine as long as you're there, Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.22,0:14:08.32,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Rin...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.75,0:14:11.85,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You're Kouki's mom...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.53,0:14:14.40,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You must be thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.40,0:14:16.08,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Wanna try sucking on some ice?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.33,0:14:33.43,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,How's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.21,0:14:38.60,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It feels good...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.41,0:14:41.15,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! You're up?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.15,0:14:42.95,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry, I was in the bathroom...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.31,0:14:44.59,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.24,0:14:47.59,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.09,0:14:52.75,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,You can have some more ice in a little bit, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.75,0:14:55.76,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,If you eat it all at once, you'll upset your tummy...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.28,0:14:57.50,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.74,0:15:05.42,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I just put something sweet and yummy in the fridge for later.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.43,0:15:07.30,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.26,0:15:17.00,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,I'm sorry. You'll be late for work, won't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.00,0:15:19.47,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Rin's really doing her best.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.03,0:15:22.74,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,If you're here for her, she'll be okay, Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.48,0:15:26.32,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Right. Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.60,0:15:29.44,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You too, Kouki. Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.69,0:15:30.56,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.42,0:15:39.52,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry. I might have to take off tomorrow too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.10,0:15:42.08,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,If something comes up, give me a call.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.08,0:15:43.06,Default,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,Gotcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.69,0:15:45.52,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for the trouble...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.52,0:15:47.29,Default,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,What are you talkin' about?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.29,0:15:49.29,Default,Kurokamihige,0000,0000,0000,,Please, leave everything to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.67,0:15:50.83,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.83,0:16:05.28,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Can you eat a little bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.28,0:16:06.18,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.34,0:16:18.20,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,When you have a cold, you get to eat all these sweets.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.07,0:16:24.41,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.81,0:16:38.55,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,You'll get better after a bit more rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.88,0:16:49.14,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Why'd it have to be Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.14,0:16:51.43,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,If I'd gotten it, it'd be nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.43,0:16:52.46,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.80,0:16:55.11,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Damn it! God damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.20,0:17:16.64,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.64,0:17:18.01,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.01,0:17:19.43,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.43,0:17:20.64,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.49,0:17:31.08,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,How do you feel, Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.08,0:17:32.61,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Does it hurt anywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.57,0:17:34.87,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.17,0:17:39.49,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I'm going to make you some yummy rice porridge now, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.66,0:17:58.76,Default,Daisuke,0000,0000,0000,,Her fever's been up again since this afternoon...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.76,0:18:00.00,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.00,0:18:03.60,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's normal for people's body temperature to rise as the day goes on.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.18,0:18:07.27,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But... it was over 102 degrees earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.29,0:18:09.49,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Here, put this in the pot.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.13,0:18:11.02,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.34,0:18:14.73,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.12,0:18:21.70,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.00,0:18:27.29,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Water...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.09,0:18:36.48,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,That looks good...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.82,0:18:39.01,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,I made it for you too, Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.43,0:18:43.93,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi! Rin wants water!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.11,0:18:45.33,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.92,0:18:53.73,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, I don't want you catching it, so stay here, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.40,0:18:56.23,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,I don't mind getting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.23,0:18:58.35,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Don't say that!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.46,0:19:08.74,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,But thanks...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.17,0:19:20.55,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.55,0:19:23.85,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki, when you're here, Rin feels totally at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.52,0:19:26.48,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.83,0:19:33.77,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Here, Rin, eat a little bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.68,0:19:41.07,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,Don't worry. When Kouki gets sick, he eats this too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.07,0:19:43.70,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,It's special porridge that makes you get better fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.81,0:19:46.66,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kouki too?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.96,0:19:47.93,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,That's right...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.93,0:19:51.94,Default,Kouki's Mom,0000,0000,0000,,When he eats this, his cold just disappears!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.87,0:20:04.08,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.57,0:20:13.60,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.30,0:20:28.77,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Rin! Are you better?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.70,0:20:30.58,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.68,0:20:33.71,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I feel fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.63,0:20:52.09,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'm hungry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.82,0:21:04.95,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}A sunny early Sunday afternoon
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.95,0:21:07.99,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Let's go somewhere today
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.29,0:21:14.87,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}It's the same road I'm used to traveling
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.87,0:21:19.38,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}But I can see it sparkling so bright
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.55,0:21:24.88,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}With the sun shining down its warmth
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.84,0:21:29.60,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}And you here by my side...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.60,0:21:34.43,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}I'm already high, high, high {Oh i'm sure of that}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.43,0:21:39.81,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}I feel like dashing out
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.19,0:21:44.65,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Sing, la, la, la
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.03,0:21:50.12,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}My voice out to forever
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.66,0:21:55.08,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}I'm already high, high, high
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.33,0:22:00.50,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Ride the dancing wind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.13,0:22:05.59,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}Sing, la, la, la
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.88,0:22:10.80,ED,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)}My voice springs up
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.78,0:22:29.41,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Can you give your mom my thanks for the other night?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.46,0:22:33.91,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,She looked after Rin, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.51,0:22:37.94,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, can I go home with you guys?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.29,0:22:39.87,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Again?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.87,0:22:43.30,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,Your mom has to be the one who picks you up from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.61,0:22:47.63,Default,Kouki,0000,0000,0000,,But my mom's in bed with a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.63,0:22:49.88,Default,Daikichi,0000,0000,0000,,What?! Are you serious?!
